@prefix pc: <https://example.invalid/nebula/ont/commercial-example/> .
@prefix d: <https://example.invalid/nebula/data/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-insurance-core> a owl:Ontology ; owl:versionIRI <https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-insurance-core/1> .

pc:Policy a owl:Class .
pc:PolicyTerm a owl:Class .
pc:ProductType a owl:Class .
pc:Submission a owl:Class .
pc:Coverage a owl:Class .
pc:LiabilityCoverage a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:Coverage .
pc:MonetaryTerm a owl:Class .
pc:Limit a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:MonetaryTerm .
pc:Deductible a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:MonetaryTerm .
pc:LossNotice a owl:Class .
pc:forAccount a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:range pc:Account .
pc:productType a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Policy ; rdfs:range pc:ProductType .
pc:termOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:PolicyTerm ; rdfs:range pc:Policy ; owl:inverseOf pc:hasTerm .
pc:hasTerm a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Policy ; rdfs:range pc:PolicyTerm .
pc:coverageOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Coverage ; rdfs:range pc:PolicyTerm ; owl:inverseOf pc:hasCoverage .
pc:hasCoverage a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:PolicyTerm ; rdfs:range pc:Coverage .
pc:hasMonetaryTerm a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Coverage ; rdfs:range pc:MonetaryTerm .
pc:reportsPolicy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:LossNotice ; rdfs:range pc:Policy .
pc:policyNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Policy ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pc:periodStart a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:PolicyTerm ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
pc:periodEnd a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:PolicyTerm ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
pc:basis a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:MonetaryTerm ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pc:amount a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:MonetaryTerm ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
pc:currency a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:MonetaryTerm ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pc:requestedLine a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Submission ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
pc:reportedLossDate a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:LossNotice ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
